        "content": "<h1>Dig In</h1><p><em>Talons gouge the stone beneath its immense body.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-red-dragon-dig-in</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>Gain Stability 3 while on solid ground until its next turn; highest source only.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
